{"ticker":"COR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:41:38Z","profile":{"longName":"Cencora, Inc.","shortName":"Cencora, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cencora.com","fullTimeEmployees":47000,"marketCap":63133257728,"trailingPE":24.561247,"forwardPE":16.730326,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.18971965,"pegRatio":0.69,"targetMeanPrice":369.08334,"targetHighPrice":400.0,"targetLowPrice":330.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.051,"earningsGrowth":0.119,"grossMargins":0.03961,"operatingMargins":0.014149999,"profitMargins":0.00789,"totalRevenue":332771328000,"beta":0.581,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":377.54,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":244.82,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.73},"summary":"Cencora, Inc. sources and distributes pharmaceutical products in the United States and internationally. The company's U.S. Healthcare Solutions segment distributes generic and injectable pharmaceuticals, over-the-counter healthcare products, home healthcare supplies and equipment, and related services to acute care hospitals and health systems, independent and chain retail pharmacies, mail order pharmacies, medical clinics, long-term care and alternate site pharmacies, and other customers; distributes plasma and other blood products, vaccines, and other specialty pharmaceutical products; provides pharmacy management, staffing, and other consulting services; supply management software to retail and institutional healthcare providers; packaging solutions to institutional and retail healthcare providers; clinical trial support, product post-approval, and commercialization support services; data analytics, outcomes research, and other services for biotechnology and pharmaceutical manufacturers; pharmaceuticals, vaccines, parasiticides, diagnostics, micro feed ingredients, and other products to the companion animal and production animal markets; sales force services to manufacturers; and offers other services to physicians who specialize in various disease states, such as oncology, as well as to other healthcare providers, including hospitals and dialysis clinics. Its International ","summary_zh":"Cencora, Inc. 在美國和國際上採購和分銷藥品。該公司的美國醫療保健解決方案部門向急診醫院和衛生系統、獨立和連鎖零售藥房、郵購藥房、醫療診所、長期護理和備用地點藥房以及其他客戶分銷仿製藥和注射藥品、非處方醫療保健產品、家庭保健用品和設備以及相關服務；分銷血漿和其他血液製品、疫苗和其他特種藥房；醫療保健提供者提供包裝解決方案；臨床試驗支援、產品批准後和商業化支援服務；為生物技術和製藥製造商提供數據分析、結果研究和其他服務；藥品、疫苗、殺寄生蟲劑、診斷劑、微量飼料成分以及伴侶動物和生產動物市場的其他產品；為製造商提供銷售人員服務；並為專門研究各種疾病狀態（例如腫瘤學）的醫生以及其他醫療保健診所（例如醫療保健學）的醫生和其他醫療保健診所（例如腫瘤學）。其國際","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療配送","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":291.97,"h":297.16,"l":290.99,"c":294.85,"v":1452100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":295.02,"h":296.0,"l":292.74,"c":295.14,"v":1225300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":295.6,"h":298.09,"l":291.19,"c":292.7,"v":1246200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":290.85,"h":293.79,"l":290.05,"c":292.5,"v":1012900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":292.77,"h":298.3,"l":290.67,"c":297.86,"v":2794200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":298.58,"h":300.25,"l":296.29,"c":298.67,"v":1720400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":297.5,"h":301.18,"l":295.22,"c":296.32,"v":1378300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":297.32,"h":303.62,"l":295.68,"c":302.8,"v":1429000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":302.22,"h":307.51,"l":301.99,"c":302.52,"v":1189400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":301.4,"h":303.3,"l":291.32,"c":291.4,"v":2330500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":291.55,"h":292.92,"l":287.3,"c":290.0,"v":1792800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":292.17,"h":293.03,"l":287.63,"c":289.08,"v":1761600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":287.61,"h":291.25,"l":285.76,"c":290.84,"v":1321700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":291.55,"h":293.71,"l":289.51,"c":290.02,"v":7226400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":290.02,"h":292.3,"l":285.83,"c":288.79,"v":1097300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":290.4,"h":302.93,"l":290.0,"c":302.4,"v":1328600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":301.7,"h":309.64,"l":301.2,"c":308.36,"v":1549300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":310.0,"h":310.0,"l":289.81,"c":298.82,"v":1988200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":301.17,"h":307.31,"l":299